  <info>## WHAT IS PLANAR?

Welcome to Planar, a 2d platformer merge of the puzzle games Portal and Manifold Garden!

This unique game f͇ͦ͊̐͑o̶̱̩ͅř͙̪͓̉c̷̘̲e̞̠̩̖̎s̨ͦ INVITES you to use the physics of changing gravity and portals AT THE SAME TIME to solve puzzles!

